            "content": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 1px; border-color: #000000;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.8632%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Ce</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">i</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">de Fields</span></h3>\n<p>&bull; an important Neolithic archaeological site in the northwest of Ireland</p>\n<p><strong>Discovery</strong></p>\n<p>&bull; In the 1930s, a local teacher realised that stones beneath the bog surface</p>\n<p>were once <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span>.</p>\n<p>&bull; His <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span>&nbsp;became an archaeologist and undertook an investigation of the site:</p>\n<p>- a traditional method used by local people to dig for <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span> was used to identify where stones were located</p>\n<p>- carbon dating later proved the site was Neolithic.</p>\n<p>&bull; Items are well preserved in the bog because of a lack of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span>.</p>\n<p><strong>Neolithic farmers</strong></p>\n<p>&bull; Houses were <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span>&nbsp;in shape and had a hole in the roof.</p>\n<p>&bull; Neolithic innovations include:</p>\n<p>- cooking indoors</p>\n<p>- pots used for storage and to make <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span>.</p>\n<p>&bull; Each field at Ceide was large enough to support a big <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span>.</p>\n<p>&bull; The fields were probably used to restrict the grazing of animals - no</p>\n<p>evidence of structures to house them during <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span>.</p>\n<p><strong>Reasons for the decline in farming</strong></p>\n<p>&bull; a decline in <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span>&nbsp;quality</p>\n<p>&bull; an increase in <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span>.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
